- Regime Filter:
    - Close above EMA 20
    - EMA 20 slope > 0
    - ADX > 20 or ADX rising
    - Omega > 50

- Entry Trigger
    - RSI 3 pulls below 30, then crosses back above 30, or
    - RSI 3 crosses above 50 while RSI 21 > 50
- Avoid Filter:
    - ATR% not too high
    - Avoid entries after giant candles

- Exit : 
    - Hold 3-10 bars
    - Exit if RSI 3 > 70 or 80
    - Exit if close falls below EMA 20
    - Stop below recent swing low or 1.5 ATR
    - Target 5% 